# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file; Vercel reads vercel.json.
#
# Nothing here is load-bearing for authorisation - that is row level security
# in Postgres. These reduce the damage a hostile page can do with a session
# that is already signed in.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
